# A run's raw output: results/<runId>/. Ignored until a run is published;
# results/README.md states where a published run goes and what it must meet.
results/*
!results/README.md
!results/published/
# The repo root ignores every `lib` directory (package build output). Here `lib/` is
# source: the harness modules and each arm's own src/lib.
!lib/
*.tsbuildinfo
